          <p>
            The other safety features are not optional either, and they are free. A riving knife — a curved plate that rides behind the blade and keeps the kerf open — is the single most effective defence against kickback, which is the other way this tool hurts people. Use it for every cut that does not require its removal, keep the guard on for through cuts, and never make a freehand cut without the fence or miter gauge.
